&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 1; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;池田　和明&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 162.2px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 1; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;13回/13回（出席率100％）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
